{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/micromatch/braces/pulls/72","id":4590195520,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAYS4588AAAABEZjTQA","html_url":"https://github.com/micromatch/braces/pull/72","diff_url":"https://github.com/micromatch/braces/pull/72.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/micromatch/braces/pull/72.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/micromatch/braces/issues/72","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/micromatch/braces/pulls/72/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/micromatch/braces/pulls/72/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/micromatch/braces/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/micromatch/braces/issues/72/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/micromatch/braces/statuses/d0d575e55e74a4e0218e5248fafb79efc3e54ebb","number":72,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: prevent stack overflow from deeply nested patterns (CVE-2026-93687)","user":{"login":"FSDevelop","id":10741996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzQxOTk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10741996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop","html_url":"https://github.com/FSDevelop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes CVE-2026-93687 and closes #70.\n\n`braces` through 3.0.3 allows an attacker-controlled, deeply nested brace pattern to exhaust the JavaScript call stack in its recursive AST walkers. Because the payload fits under the existing 10,000-character input limit, an unauthenticated attacker can trigger an uncaught `RangeError` and terminate the Node.js process, causing a denial of service.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Limit brace and parenthesis nesting to 100 levels while parsing.\n- Apply the same limit to `compile`, `expand`, and `stringify` so caller-supplied ASTs cannot bypass parser validation.\n- Allow callers to configure a stricter `maxDepth` while capping larger values at the safe maximum.\n- Document the new `maxDepth` option.\n- Add regression coverage for string inputs, direct AST inputs, and the allowed boundary.\n\n## Verification\n\nThe complete Mocha test suite passes: **899 passing tests**, including the new parser, compile, expand, and stringify depth-limit regression tests. Targeted public-API boundary checks, JavaScript syntax checks, and whitespace checks also pass.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-21T09:55:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T05:08:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a37830acb8cd9e1d1262993de6c4a3bc52792d8e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"FSDevelop:fix/limit-nesting-depth","ref":"fix/limit-nesting-depth","repo":{"id":1379445747,"node_id":"R_kgDOUjir8w","name":"braces","full_name":"FSDevelop/braces","owner":{"login":"FSDevelop","id":10741996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzQxOTk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10741996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop","html_url":"https://github.com/FSDevelop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FSDevelop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.